OL,5,G1200 Don't Tell the Bride
OL,6,     FThe One with the Prague Stag:
OL,7,     FGroom Ryan is determined to give
OL,8,     Fhis bride Fern a classy, glamorous
OL,9,     Fwedding. His best man has his own
OL,10,     Fagenda: a no-holds-barred stag do
OL,11,     Fin party city Prague.
OL,12,G1300 Don't Tell the Bride
OL,13,     FThe One with Shoegate: Hannah
OL,14,     Fknows exactly what she wants from
OL,15,     Fher wedding. And after a five-day
OL,16,     Fstag including a trip to Poland,
OL,17,     Fgroom Andy feels her wrath when he
OL,18,     Fmakes a footwear error.
